    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "sdc02_0085_sister_02",
      "hash64": "3A154D7B04EB62E5",
      "text": "I heard the news! You got picked for Blueberry\\nAcademy’s exchange program, right?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "sdc02_0085_sister_03",
      "hash64": "3A154C7B04EB6132",
      "text": "Hah! One of my teachers told me. Never thought\\nwe’d be fellow students of BB Academy![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "sdc02_0085_sister_04",
      "hash64": "3A15477B04EB58B3",
      "text": "Nice try, but you can’t fool me! I’ve already got\\nsolid confirmation you’ve been enrolled here![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "sdc02_0085_sister_05",
      "hash64": "3A15467B04EB5700",
      "text": "Anyway, you should totally come show your face.\\nIt’s been too long already![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "sdc02_0085_sister_06",
      "hash64": "3A15497B04EB5C19",
      "text": "Now, let me think... Where could we meet up?\\nOh! Have you been to the Terarium?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "sdc02_0085_sister_07",
      "hash64": "3A15487B04EB5A66",
      "text": "There’s a space called the Central Plaza right in\\nthe center of the dome! I’ll meet you there!\\c\\nDon’t keep me waiting if you know what’s good\\nfor you![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
